      "textContext": "Diagram 54 \n\n62 \nH O W  T O  R E A S S E S S  Y O U R  C H E S S  - 4 T H  E D I T I O N  \nOnce a useful defender, now black's Bishop has morphed into a fierce attacker! \n13.Rh4 Qf5 14.Bxd3 Rxd3 15.Rf4 Qh3 16.RxfB+ Kh7 17.0 Rxd2 18.Qxd2 \nQxg3+ 19.Qg2 Qel+, 1h-'h. \nThe Tall-Pawn \nA Bishop is said to be a Tall-Pawn if it's not serving a useful function and is \ntrapped behind its pawns (thus making it inactive). This kind of Bishop takes \non the persona of an overgrown pawn and is something you should desperately \ntry and avoid having. \nThe worst cases of Tall-Pawns occur when a Bishop finds itself entombed. \nHere's a graphic example:",
